OL,3,AExtra 200 police aid crash and fire
OL,4,Adeaths force
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlec Brown, leader of Redcar and
OL,7,FCleveland Council, said armed officers,
OL,8,Fdog units and "community bobbies" were
OL,9,Famong the additional personnel
OL,10,Fsupporting local detectives.
OL,12,FCleveland Police said it was receiving
OL,13,Fsupport from neighbouring forces, but
OL,14,Fexact numbers were "changing all the
OL,15,Ftime".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
