OL,3,AConvicted Bosnian Serb war criminal
OL,4,AMladiDG dies aged 84
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sentence for the man known as the
OL,7,F"Butcher of Bosnia" was upheld on
OL,8,Fappeal by the UN court in 2021. He was
OL,9,Fbeing given palliative care in the
OL,10,Fhospital of the UN detention facility,
OL,11,Fwhere he died.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
